+        "coordinate, so subtracting the paired zero-residual equations isolates "
+        "each coordinate while a generic method eliminates the whole dense system."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 5.2 reduces linear TVCSP minimization to linear "
+        "programming (polynomial time); the measured O(m*n^2) fraction-free "
+        "elimination reference takes 0.844 seconds and 1,406,272 exact operations "
+        "at the shipping preset, whereas the row-pair invariant needs 192 exact "
